WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.400
In Russia.

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:00.834
A Moscow

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.035
court expected to hold the first

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:03.803
hearing in a new criminal case

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.905
against the imprisoned Putin critic

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:07.974
and opposition leader Alexei Navalny.

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:09.843
These new charges stem

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:12.178
from an incident at the penal colony.

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.080
Yes, those still exist in Russia,

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.782
where Navalny is being detained.

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:18.118
Allegedly an inmate with, quote, poor

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.520
hygiene was placed in his cell,

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.721
prompting Navalny to drag

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.823
the inmate out of the cell.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:26.593
Guards then physically assaulted Navalny.

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.094
Now the opposition leader

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.696
could be facing even more prison time

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.331
in addition to the 11 and a half years.

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.099
He is already facing

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:33.867
all this as

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.101
there are growing concerns

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.404
about his physical condition and health.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.806
He said to be severely ill

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.908
with his health deteriorating rapidly.

00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:42.509
Joining me

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:43.276
now is Navalny's

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.779
doctor, daughter, Dasha Navalny.

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:46.513
It's great to have you on

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.683
Thank you so much for having me.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:53.153
First, I want to unfortunately

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:55.622
say that you're

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:56.656
right.

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.191
Now, what's happening

00:00:58.191 --> 00:00:58.758
tomorrow is

00:00:58.758 --> 00:00:59.392
what's happening

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.895
is not a court case hearing.

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:02.495
And that's what

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:03.663
the Russian propaganda

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.231
wants you to understand,

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.767
to be confused about what's happening

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.869
tomorrow is a potential

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:13.106
judge ruling on

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:14.974
whether the defendant

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.910
can become familiarized

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.478
with the court case,

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:19.079
which is

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:21.514
even ridiculous in its own place.

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:25.351
What's in the case is for extremism

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.454
and the justification of fascism,

00:01:27.454 --> 00:01:29.456
which is an absurd accusation.

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:30.590
And

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:34.561
basically, the prosecution has asked

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.530
the judge to not give

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:39.499
the defendant, my dad,

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:41.501
any time to prepare for the case.

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:44.671
And the case has the case has 150 volumes

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:47.974
in each volume, which is already a lot.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:48.842
And each volume

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:51.945
there's 250 double spaced pages.

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:54.747
And basically preparing,

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.249
even if they don't have it,

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:57.550
even if they do get time,

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.185
preparing for the process

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:00.053
will be impossible

00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:01.321
because my dad's lawyers

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:04.324
are forced to communicate through a firm

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:07.227
and they can't exchange documents.

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:08.928
They can't really talk. They can't.

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.564
Basically they can't.

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.366
They can't see the case

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:15.135
that it's going against my dad,

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.736
which is very concerning.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:17.804
And

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.540
of course, any defendant

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.709
in around the world, in Russia

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:24.444
anywhere can talk to their lawyers

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:26.146
in order to prepare for their hearings.

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:27.814
My dad can't.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:30.550
Yes, let's listen.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:31.417
It's a great point.

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:32.118
And I was going to ask you,

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:34.220
because we should note this,

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:34.988
the Russian court

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:37.323
system operates essentially in cases

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:38.858
like this as an extension of the Kremlin.

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:39.692
It is not.

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.861
It may purport to be a fair process,

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:42.428
but in fact,

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:44.297
it is a very much orchestrated

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:45.899
process here.

00:02:45.899 --> 00:02:47.700
I wonder then,

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.168
as you

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:50.170
watch this play out, as you have before,

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:50.803
I mean, your father

00:02:50.803 --> 00:02:52.505
sitting in a penal colony,

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.173
not to mention

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:55.508
survived a horrible poisoning attempt

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.977
by the Russian regime.

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.046
What is his best hope

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:02.282
as this, quote unquote legal process

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:04.551
plays out? Is it public attention

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:08.354
Public attention, definitely.

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.623
We have no idea.

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.659
Also, one of the huge problems with

00:03:13.159 --> 00:03:14.027
the justice system

00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:15.228
being an

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:17.230
answering to the government itself

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:19.699
is the fact that we don't know

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:20.967
when the actual court hearing

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:22.202
was going to happen.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:23.336
We don't know whether it's

00:03:23.336 --> 00:03:24.537
going to be open or closed.

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:26.673
We don't know if we're able to have

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:30.210
any press in the during the hearings.

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:32.378
And, you know, for my dad,

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:33.479
this is a big problem

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.248
then for any other political prisoner

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:36.149
in Russia.

00:03:36.149 --> 00:03:39.219
This is going to become you know,

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:40.853
they're just going to be put in prison

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:41.821
without a court hearing

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:42.722
because it's closed

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:43.756
and because no one's there

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:44.524
to support them.

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:45.592
They don't have attorneys

00:03:45.592 --> 00:03:46.025
they don't

00:03:46.025 --> 00:03:47.427
they don't have the time to prepare

00:03:47.427 --> 00:03:48.795
for their hearings.

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:50.396
And, of course,

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:51.364
international attention

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:52.899
is what we need the most right now.

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:56.169
Can I ask you what your

00:03:56.469 --> 00:03:57.770
knowledge is at this point

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.606
of your father's health and

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:01.908
and what your concern is

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:03.376
that he might be poisoned again?

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:04.110
I mean, first of all,

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:05.511
the confinement he's going through

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:07.547
is a threat enough?

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:08.648
But are you concerned

00:04:08.648 --> 00:04:10.183
that authorities might

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:14.153
take another step, try to take his life

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:15.688
Of course,

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:17.590
there's always the concern of

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.558
worsening health

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:21.394
or even more radical approaches

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:23.763
