00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.698
Actually, this morning, my dad,

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:27.300
one of my dad's attorneys

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.568
has confirmed that according

00:04:28.568 --> 00:04:29.369
to the new rules

00:04:29.369 --> 00:04:30.069
that they

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:33.106
specifically drew up for my dad, he's

00:04:33.106 --> 00:04:34.440
now a little

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:35.808
limited to the amount of food

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:37.644
that he can purchase in the canteen,

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:39.245
which is which doesn't seem like this

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:40.013
