00:04:40.013 --> 00:04:41.281
But the food in the Russian

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:43.616
prison system is bad.

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:45.918
And my dad has had some problems

00:04:45.918 --> 00:04:47.687
