00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:51.057
And now that the situation

00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:53.660
has gotten so ridiculous that he buys

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.461
the food, which is, you know.

00:04:56.562 --> 00:04:57.263
It's nothing.

00:04:57.263 --> 00:04:57.864
It's nothing

00:04:57.864 --> 00:05:00.033
but curious in the cute bites, the oats.

