00:05:25.925 --> 00:05:27.560
everyone who's a political prisoner

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:28.861
in Russia right now

00:05:28.861 --> 00:05:31.931
of some such basic needs as feeding food

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:33.833
And we should note to people

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:34.667
that this is deliberate.

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:35.768
Right, of the system,

00:05:35.768 --> 00:05:38.104
